                },
                "description": "Retrieves one or more projects, including the documents associated with each project. Retrieving a project is the most efficient way to retrieve a single project, multiple projects or a list of all available projects.\n\nTo retrieve a specific project, specify the `id` request parameter or you can retrieve multiple projects by adding comma (,) between ids eg. `?id=1234,5678`. To retrieve all projects, omit the `id` request parameter. To limit the retrieved projects to those with a particular source language or target language, specify the corresponding ISO 639-1 language codes in the `srclang` and `trglang` request parameters, respectively."
